Metadata-Version: 2.4
Name: canoe-worker
Version: 0.1.0
Summary: Generic worker image: consumes a Kafka topic, runs a user-supplied step function, produces to the next topic. Step code is resolved at startup from CANOE_CODE_SOURCE, so the same image serves every Python step in a pipeline.
Requires-Python: >=3.11
Requires-Dist: confluent-kafka>=2.4
Requires-Dist: boto3>=1.34
Requires-Dist: pyarrow>=15.0
